@startuml 01_as_is_component
title EPIC-021 — AS-IS: không có khái niệm môi trường, không có đường đi lệnh

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Presentation" {
  [SettingsPresenter] as SP
  [Dev Board / Backtest / Data Management] as SCR
}

package "Application" {
  [MarketTickEventHandler] as MTH
  [StrategyEngine] as SE
  [SyncMarketDataCommandHandler] as SYNC
  interface IExchangeClient as IEC
  interface ILiveStreamService as ILS
}

package "Infrastructure" {
  [PythonBinanceClient] as PBC
  [BinanceWebsocketService] as BWS
}

cloud "api.binance.com\n(MAINNET, ẩn danh)" as MAINNET
database "user_config.json\n(git-tracked)" as UCFG

SP --> UCFG : ghi API_KEY / API_SECRET
note right of UCFG
  **BUG-078** — không ai đọc ra.
  Key không bao giờ tới client.
end note

SYNC ..> IEC
IEC <|.. PBC
ILS <|.. BWS
PBC --> MAINNET : Client("", "")\n**không tham số, luôn mainnet**
BWS --> MAINNET : AsyncClient.create()

SCR ..> SYNC

MTH --> MTH : logger.info(...)
note bottom of MTH
  Điểm cuối của luồng live hôm nay.
  "Here we will later invoke domain logic"
  — StrategyEngine chưa từng chạy ở đây.
end note

SE ..> [RunBacktest handler] : chỉ backtest gọi on_tick()

note as N1
  **Không tồn tại:** ITradingClient, Order,
  LivePosition, ExecuteOrderCommand,
  User Data Stream, Emergency Stop.
  **Config chết:** BINANCE_REST_URL / BINANCE_WS_URL (BUG-079)
end note

@enduml
